# Asset bytes are content-addressed by Manta, so a checkout must not rewrite them.
#
# manta6_corpus_baseline.collect_assets walks assets/<modid> with NO extension
# filter and sha256s every file it finds. That ledger is where this repository is
# actually exposed: 37 of its 40 tracked asset files contain line endings and so
# convert - blockstates, lang, models, wiki/*.md, wiki/index.json.
#
# NOT the authoring fingerprint, which is what this comment claimed when it was
# first written. Measured 2026-08-20 after a second reading refuted it: all three
# of this repo's layout JSONs are minified onto a single line and contain zero
# line endings, so no conversion can move 29c28419 - a fresh clone with
# core.autocrlf=true was measured to reproduce it exactly. That sentence was
# inferred from Trainsystemutilities, where two layout files DO convert and the
# fingerprint really had moved. Corrected here rather than left, because this is
# the file a third consumer's .gitattributes gets copied from.
#
# The same lesson is written in manta's own .gitattributes for its icon SVGs,
# and enumerated there by reading the code that hashes rather than by recalling
# which directories matter - extending that list by hand missed twelve files.
src/*/resources/assets/spatialaudiosystem/** -text
